WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.320
Arthur does it help to have someone to
talk to

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:18.020
my mother always tells me to smile and
put on a happy face

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:23.360
she told me I had a purpose

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:27.940
to bring laughter and joy to the world

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:38.680
is it just me

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.340
or is it getting crazier out there

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:20.240
what's so funny

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:32.800
Gotham has lost its way

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:40.080
what kind of coward would do something
that cold-blooded someone who hides

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:41.220
behind a mask

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:53.060
I used to think that my life was a
tragedy

00:01:58.460 --> 00:01:59.820
but now I realize

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:03.160
it's a comedy

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:19.020
you just might

